        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whiteboard photos you take or pick may be sent to a recognition service to extract WOD content. Your workout logs and profile are stored on this device based on your actions, and sync to your iCloud once iCloud sync is on."
