    "开启 iCloud 同步" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn on iCloud sync"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，训练记录通过你的 iCloud 在多台设备间同步、换机不丢。数据存于你的 iCloud 私人空间，不经过我们的服务器。关闭后本机与云端数据均会保留。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once on, your workout records sync across devices through your iCloud, so nothing is lost when you switch phones. Data is stored in your private iCloud space, never on our servers. Turning it off keeps both local and cloud data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
